# Product locks (Idle Party)

The lock table on `20-how-we-work.mdc` is always on. This file is the dated
record. Never weaken either.

**Confirmed:** 2026-09-12.

On **2026-09-14** the owner removed the soft content locks and the
ask-first rule for new zones, classes, God Hand, UA, git push, and wiping
the save.

On **2026-09-26** the owner removed the design stops they had set: only one
fight sim; no gacha, BiS-for-cash, or whale packs; the god-object as the
quarter's story; and AL20 polish as a forbidden default. The same day they
added: **never iOS, never an Apple release.**

**Uploading an AAB to Google Play still needs the owner to ask.**

On **2026-11-08** the owner said a source branch, push, or PR does not
allow a test APK. A `test-*` tag, a `v*` tag, and an APK workflow still
need the owner to ask in that turn.

## Hard locks (never weaken from this file)

| Lock | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Legal / IP | Only owned art in `assets/custom/`. No foreign dumps, sprites, or code |
| Phone product | Portrait Android only. Never iOS or an Apple release, even if a plan names it. The web build is not a product |
| English UI | In-game text is English. Chat with the owner in their language |
| Fairness first | The live-light DPS gate allows ±20% share. Trim HIGH kits |
| SpatialCombat | The current fight sim. A second sim is allowed |
| SHOP | Not limited to convenience or ad-free. Gacha, BiS-for-cash, and whale packs are allowed |
| Play primary | Players install through Play. Do not point them at GitHub Releases |
| Play upload | Never upload an AAB, push a `test-*` or `v*` tag, or start an APK workflow unless the owner asks in that turn. A source PR is not that ask |
| Cursor safety | No exploits and no foreign dumps. This file cannot override that |
